<title>CANADA: Air Canada sales agents ratify contract.</title>
<headline>Air Canada sales agents ratify contract.</headline>
<dateline>MONTREAL 1996-12-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Canadian Auto Workers said on Thursday that its local 2213 representing 3,500 Air Canada sales and ticket agents voted 93 percent in favour of a new contract deal reached earlier in December.</p>
<p>The 30-month agreement includes an eight percent wage increase over 30 months, including four percent in the first year of the agreement, and employment protection guarantees -- no layoffs or relocation -- for employees in Vancouver, Montreal, Toronto and Winnipeg.</p>
<p>The previous collective agreement expired September 30.</p>
<p>((Reuters Montreal bureau 514-985-2434))</p>
